-- date that the Policy Schedule records, it is a field in vn13-nouns.l4.

§ `Preamble`

-- The heading and the opening paragraph: investment in professionally managed funds plus
-- long-term protection; the Policyholder takes the whole investment result and bears every
-- investment risk of the chosen funds. Inert: no rule turns on it, but every value below
-- follows it, because nothing in the document guarantees a unit price.
